---
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">
        About <span class="gradient-text">Me</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg">Get to know me better</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="card-hover bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 to-purple-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-100">
        <div class="text-4xl mb-4">👩‍💻</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-slate-900">Developer</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Passionate about crafting elegant solutions to complex problems. I thrive on learning new technologies
          and building things that matter.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-hover bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-50 to-rose-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-pink-100">
        <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🙌🏻</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-slate-900">Collaborator</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          I believe great products are built by great teams. I love sharing knowledge and working together
          to achieve amazing results.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-hover bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-amber-100">
        <div class="text-4xl mb-4">😯</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-slate-900">Curious Mind</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Always exploring, always questioning. I'm driven by curiosity and the desire to understand
          how things work under the hood.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
